--- error
E_SQL_UNSUPPORTED
===

### name: warrant.numeric.declared-num-through-coalesce-is-not-guarded
--- note
CONTROL: every value branch declared NUM, so the promise is the application's and nothing is wrapped.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"U": {"kind": "column", "column": "u"}, "P": {"kind": "column", "column": "p", "type": "BOOL"}, "N": {"kind": "column", "column": "n", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
(N ?? 1) + 1 > 0
--- expect
((COALESCE(`n`, 1) + 1) > 0)
===

### name: warrant.numeric.declared-num-through-if-is-not-guarded
--- note
CONTROL.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"U": {"kind": "column", "column": "u"}, "P": {"kind": "column", "column": "p", "type": "BOOL"}, "N": {"kind": "column", "column": "n", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
IF(P, N, 1) + 1 == 2
--- expect
((CASE WHEN `p` THEN `n` ELSE 1 END + 1) = 2)
===

### name: agg.join.bool-element-is-refused
--- note
SEL: JOIN takes text (`&` rules, spec 5.2/7.5): a BOOL or BIN element or separator is E_NOT_TEXT. The translator must refuse as `&` does (kinds.a-bool-is-not-concatenable), not concatenate a server's spelling of the value ('1'/'true'). (PY-C19, PHP-C31)
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"T": {"kind": "column", "column": "t", "type": "TEXT"}, "T2": {"kind": "column", "column": "t2", "type": "TEXT"}, "F": {"kind": "column", "column": "f", "type": "BOOL"}, "X": {"kind": "column", "column": "x", "type": "BIN"}, "V": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"column": "a", "type": "TEXT"}, {"column": "b", "type": "BOOL"}]}, "W": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"column": "a", "type": "TEXT"}, {"column": "b", "type": "BIN"}]}}
--- source
JOIN((T, F), ",")
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE
===

### name: agg.join.bool-first-element-is-refused
--- note
SEL: JOIN takes text (`&` rules, spec 5.2/7.5): a BOOL or BIN element or separator is E_NOT_TEXT. The translator must refuse as `&` does (kinds.a-bool-is-not-concatenable), not concatenate a server's spelling of the value ('1'/'true'). (PY-C19, PHP-C31)
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"T": {"kind": "column", "column": "t", "type": "TEXT"}, "T2": {"kind": "column", "column": "t2", "type": "TEXT"}, "F": {"kind": "column", "column": "f", "type": "BOOL"}, "X": {"kind": "column", "column": "x", "type": "BIN"}, "V": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"column": "a", "type": "TEXT"}, {"column": "b", "type": "BOOL"}]}, "W": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"column": "a", "type": "TEXT"}, {"column": "b", "type": "BIN"}]}}
--- source
