### name: agg.join.text-elements-still-translate
--- note
CONTROL: TEXT elements and a text separator are unaffected.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"T": {"kind": "column", "column": "t", "type": "TEXT"}, "T2": {"kind": "column", "column": "t2", "type": "TEXT"}, "F": {"kind": "column", "column": "f", "type": "BOOL"}, "X": {"kind": "column", "column": "x", "type": "BIN"}, "V": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"column": "a", "type": "TEXT"}, {"column": "b", "type": "BOOL"}]}, "W": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"column": "a", "type": "TEXT"}, {"column": "b", "type": "BIN"}]}}
--- source
JOIN((T, "a"), "-")
--- expect
CONCAT(CONCAT(`t`, '-'), 'a')
===

### name: agg.bucket-sum.a-declared-text-field-is-refused
--- note
The relation path refuses a declared TEXT or BOOL body (notaddressed.an-aggregate-body-declared-text-is-refused: the aggregate's own kind check); the GROUP path (`SUM(_, body)` inside BUCKET) applied no kind check at all and emitted SUM(`status`) / SUM(`flag`). SEL: SUM of a text field is E_NOT_NUM, of a BOOL E_NOT_NUM. (PHP-C27)
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"O": {"kind": "relation", "from": "orders", "alias": "o", "fields": {"CAT": {"table": "o", "column": "cat", "type": "TEXT"}, "STATUS": {"table": "o", "column": "status", "type": "TEXT"}, "FLAG": {"table": "o", "column": "flag", "type": "BOOL"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
O .> BUCKET(_["CAT"], RECORD("s", SUM(_, _["STATUS"])))
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE
===

### name: agg.bucket-sum.a-declared-bool-field-is-refused
--- note
The relation path refuses a declared TEXT or BOOL body (notaddressed.an-aggregate-body-declared-text-is-refused: the aggregate's own kind check); the GROUP path (`SUM(_, body)` inside BUCKET) applied no kind check at all and emitted SUM(`status`) / SUM(`flag`). SEL: SUM of a text field is E_NOT_NUM, of a BOOL E_NOT_NUM. (PHP-C27)
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"O": {"kind": "relation", "from": "orders", "alias": "o", "fields": {"CAT": {"table": "o", "column": "cat", "type": "TEXT"}, "STATUS": {"table": "o", "column": "status", "type": "TEXT"}, "FLAG": {"table": "o", "column": "flag", "type": "BOOL"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
O .> BUCKET(_["CAT"], RECORD("s", SUM(_, _["FLAG"])))
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE
===

### name: agg.bucket-sum.a-constant-text-body-is-refused
--- note
`SUM(_, "x")`: every argument knowable and SEL rejects it (E_NOT_NUM); it must not degrade to SUM(1) (PHP-C7 interplay). E_SQL_INVALID: docs sql/errors.md.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"O": {"kind": "relation", "from": "orders", "alias": "o", "fields": {"CAT": {"table": "o", "column": "cat", "type": "TEXT"}, "STATUS": {"table": "o", "column": "status", "type": "TEXT"}, "FLAG": {"table": "o", "column": "flag", "type": "BOOL"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
O .> BUCKET(_["CAT"], RECORD("s", SUM(_, "x")))
--- error
E_SQL_INVALID
===

### name: agg.bucket-sum.a-non-name-binder-is-refused
--- note
The three-argument SUM over a group names its binder: a slot that is not a bare name is E_EXPECT_SYMBOL in SEL, so the translation must refuse rather than sum the slot as the body (it emitted SUM('1')).
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"O": {"kind": "relation", "from": "orders", "alias": "o", "fields": {"CAT": {"table": "o", "column": "cat", "type": "TEXT"}, "AMT": {"table": "o", "column": "amt", "type": "NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
O .> BUCKET(_["CAT"], RECORD("s", SUM(_, 1, _["AMT"])))
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE
===

### name: agg.in-relation.bool-column-needle-is-refused
--- note
`x IN <relation>` must check that needle and column kinds are comparable, as `x IN (list)` does (F IN (T, T) and TRUE IN ("1","a") are refused): a BOOL or BIN needle against a TEXT column would match rows whose text happens to be '1'/'true' or the same bytes. (PY-C21)
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"S": {"kind": "relation", "from": "sk", "alias": "s", "fields": {"SKU": {"table": "s", "column": "sku", "type": "TEXT"}}, "scalar": "SKU"}, "F": {"kind": "column", "column": "f", "type": "BOOL"}, "X": {"kind": "column", "column": "x", "type": "BIN"}, "N": {"kind": "column", "column": "n", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
F IN S
--- error
E_SQL_SHAPE
===

