### name: agg.fold.any.at-257-is-balanced
--- note
Above 256 operands an associative unroll is folded as a balanced tree: n operands split ceil(n/2) left and the rest right, recursively, and 256 or fewer stay a plain left fold (docs/internals/sql-translation.md 7.1). The servers refuse a chain n deep: SQLite at an expression tree of 1000, MariaDB/MySQL by thread-stack overrun in a SUM unroll at about 900, PostgreSQL by memory at 5000. (PHP-C58, PY-C42)
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"N": {"kind": "column", "column": "n", "type": "NUM", "table": "k"}, "T": {"kind": "column", "column": "t", "type": "TEXT", "table": "k", "exact": true}}
--- source
